(a) P1 — DEBATE + PROCEDURAL RECOURSE AGAINST DEBATE ALONE  [PRE-REGISTERED]
====================================================================================================
Population: every debate cell M0 decided — Maverick's own judgment of a stored
transcript. BEFORE is that judgment against the gold label; AFTER is the
ruling's verdict where M1's contest produced a ruling and the judgment's own
verdict otherwise.

alpha = 0.05. ONE JUDGE, ONE TEST: judgment-debate-2 ran two judges and
split its alpha over them; there is no family here to correct over.

The same model judged the debate and ruled on the appeal against its own
judgment. That is the design, it is stated in PREREG.md, and sections (b) and
(c) are what bound it — a second look with no information, and one with wrong
information.

