(e) THE PRELUDE — WHAT CAME BEFORE, AND WHY IT IS NOT THE RESULT
====================================================================================================
The finished nano run and the abandoned chain's arms, each recomputed here from
its own committed index so the numbers in this log all come from one script.

WHY THE CHAIN WAS STOPPED, and it is the whole reason this phase exists: those
flash-class judges are STRONGER than the nano that judged the debates, so their
nets measure 'a better judge re-decided' as much as they measure recourse. This
phase removes the asymmetry instead of modelling it. Read these rows as a
record of the instrument, not as an effect.

